{"id":"239d08888e8a2799","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-subcompact.md","title":"Subcompact Cardinal","display":"df-subcompact — Subcompact Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-subcompact","aliases":["58-df-subcompact"],"display":"df-subcompact — Subcompact Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-subcompact"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-subcompact</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subcompact — Subcompact Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8670ef2cc176069b\" href=\"?note=8670ef2cc176069b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set\">58-df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\kappa,H_\\rho\\in V\">\\(H_\\kappa,H_\\rho\\in V\\)</span> (bounded hereditary-size carriers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S\\)</span> (hereditary-size predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subcompact}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\operatorname{Subcompact}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subcompact}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Subcompact}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land\\exists H_\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\nH_\\kappa=\\{x\\in V_{\\kappa^+}:\\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S(x,\\kappa^+)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(H_\\kappa)\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists H_\\rho,\\bar A,j\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\rho)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13mm}\\land H_\\rho=\\{x\\in V_{\\rho^+}:\\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S(x,\\rho^+)\\}\n\\land\\bar A\\in\\mathcal P(H_\\rho)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13mm}\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\!\\left(\nj,\n\\langle H_\\rho,\\in\\cap(H_\\rho\\times H_\\rho),\\bar A\\rangle,\n\\langle H_\\kappa,\\in\\cap(H_\\kappa\\times H_\\kappa),A\\rangle\n\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13mm}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,H_\\rho,H_\\kappa)\n\\land j(\\rho)=\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\rho\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subcompact}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Subcompact}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land\\exists H_\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\nH_\\kappa=\\{x\\in V_{\\kappa^+}:\\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S(x,\\kappa^+)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(H_\\kappa)\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists H_\\rho,\\bar A,j\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\rho)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13mm}\\land H_\\rho=\\{x\\in V_{\\rho^+}:\\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S(x,\\rho^+)\\}\n\\land\\bar A\\in\\mathcal P(H_\\rho)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13mm}\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\!\\left(\nj,\n\\langle H_\\rho,\\in\\cap(H_\\rho\\times H_\\rho),\\bar A\\rangle,\n\\langle H_\\kappa,\\in\\cap(H_\\kappa\\times H_\\kappa),A\\rangle\n\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13mm}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,H_\\rho,H_\\kappa)\n\\land j(\\rho)=\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\rho\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both hereditary-size carriers are bounded subsets of cumulative-hierarchy stages and invoke the registered hereditary-cardinality predicate.  The definition reflects every predicate on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\kappa^+}\">\\(H_{\\kappa^+}\\)</span> to some cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho&lt;\\kappa\">\\(\\rho&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> with critical point <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal"